44
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:32,240
Nobody will even notice. The Beautiful Mathematics of Mutual Stupidity Reduction.

45
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:41,780
If EVERYONE reduces their military budget by exactly one percent at exactly the same time, everyone maintains exactly the

46
