159
00:18:42,940 --> 00:18:49,180
Treaties fail in predictable ways. Here's how this one avoids the common killers: Reservation Games.

160
00:18:50,220 --> 00:18:53,760
Countries love to sign treaties then add exceptions that gut them.

161
00:18:54,560 --> 00:18:57,920
