173
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:18,140
Direct effect in domestic law (per the Supremacy Clause in the U.S., similar provisions elsewhere).

174
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:27,720
Summary. A one percent treaty is a piece of paper that says "Let's spend one percent less on killing and one percent more

175
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:33,120
