treaty fund advantages. Your opponents get what you forfeit.

192
00:22:37,500 --> 00:22:42,740
Article VI: Success metrics trigger mandatory percentage reviews.

193
00:22:42,820 --> 00:22:50,370
When it works, we do more. Article VII: Citizens have standing to enforce via domestic courts.

194
