196
00:23:08,100 --> 00:23:14,740
Yes, even that law. Article X: Entry into force upon signature by two states.

197
00:23:15,340 --> 00:23:22,640
You only need two countries brave enough to go first. IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the undersigned, being of sound mind and tired

198
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:27,820
